  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>*</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;be the largest value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi></math> for which the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>&#955;</mi></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>36</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>36</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>48</mn></math>&nbsp;is increasing for all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>*</mo></msup></msub><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>*</mo></mrow></msub><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to:"
  },
