  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>&#955;</mi></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>36</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>36</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>48</mn></math></p><p>Differentiating w.r.t&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;both side we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>f</mi><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msubsup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>72</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>36</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>&#955;</mi></msub><mmultiscripts><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mo>&#39;</mo></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>36</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mrow><mi>largest</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>36</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>48</mn></math></p><p>So,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>72</mn></math></p>"
  }
